{"articles":[{"no":"第一條","path":[],"text":"宜蘭縣政府(以下簡稱本府)為統一建築物造價估算基準，依宜蘭縣建築管理自治條例第二十三條規定訂定本標準。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL051000/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"e82eda442ee51129bd8c4225f854a960e173dea3f20c5065f54c13a52afecd92","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二條","path":[],"text":"宜蘭縣各種構造建築物之造價估算基準如附表。\n\n前項附表，由本府依行政院主計總處公告之「臺灣地區消費者物價總指數」變動情形，每二年檢討一次並公告之。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL051000/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"8cf89ddc647dbdc941046c177077eed29fb35d3f4ca45e28cba8148920649147","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第三條","path":[],"text":"依本標準所公告之各種構造建築物之造價，係作為本府收取建築執照規費及罰鍰之核算依據。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL051000/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"7c10761a33b4796a924c2f16127c89db5100217769d48059e295ba26542f8bee","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第四條","path":[],"text":"依本標準所公告之各種構造建築物之造價，不包含水電及其設備部分；未公告之雜項工作物造價，由建築師覈實估算之。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL051000/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"e5f15d09edffb5e9c04806ad295c649448396ac1023dea763376ec3ac7933374","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第五條","path":[],"text":"本標準自發布日施行。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL051000/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"0760487a7e1a3f98a433704c163a939df3ca09942ff350f224457b344857930a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"宜蘭縣建築物造價估算標準修正條文對照表.odt","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=4028&id=FL051000&type=LAW"},{"title":"宜蘭縣建築物造價估算標準修正總說明.odt","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=4027&id=FL051000&type=LAW"},{"title":"修正前附表.odt","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=4029&id=FL051000&type=LAW"},{"title":"修正後附表.odt","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=4030&id=FL051000&type=LAW"},{"title":"宜蘭縣建築物造價估算標準條文.odt","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=4031&id=FL051000&type=LAW"},{"title":"附表.odt","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=4033&id=FL051000&type=LAW"}],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"宜蘭縣-FL051000","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"民國 112 年 06 月 07 日","name":"宜蘭縣建築物造價估算標準","region":"宜蘭縣","source":"宜蘭縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=FL051000","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:34+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"2b856db3b3211b2ae6c0e0cda9b3014e9ea059951c5385284361b240e5dada33","sourceRecordId":"宜蘭縣-FL051000","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"民國 112 年 06 月 07 日","effectiveDate":""}}